{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123372","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123372/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123372/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123372/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123372","id":5414577395,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQrvk8w","number":123372,"title":"Export to Mac App Store missing required LSMinimumSystemVersion key in info.plist","user":{"login":"lostminds","id":17763524,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzYzNTI0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17763524?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds","html_url":"https://github.com/lostminds","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097780,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc3ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:macos","name":"platform:macos","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2909900850,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyOTA5OTAwODUw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:export","name":"topic:export","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-09-10T16:07:58Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T17:12:35Z","closed_at":"2026-09-10T16:26:01Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.7.2\n\n### System information\n\nmacOS 26.6.2\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen exporting for submission to the Apple Mac App Store Godot generates a nice signed .pkg package for you if you select the Distribution type \"App Store\" that you can then submit via the Transporter app.\n\nHowever, it seems the generated app bundle info.plist is missing a LSMinimumSystemVersion key that is required for apps submitted to the App Store. So the packages will be rejected in Transporter. \n\nLooking at the info.plist generated by Godot it now contains:\n```\n<key>LSMinimumSystemVersionByArchitecture</key>\n\t<dict>\n\t\t<key>arm64</key>\n\t\t<string>13.00</string>\n\t\t<key>x86_64</key>\n\t\t<string>11.00</string>\n\t</dict>\n``` \n\nWhich is probably meant to replace LSMinimumSystemVersion. However, it seems the App Store package analysis specifically requires LSMinimumSystemVersion to be present. So if you just add\n```\n<key>LSMinimumSystemVersion</key>\n<string>13.0</string>\n```\nIt will accept the package. It seems a little redundant to have both, but for the app store submission it seems to be required at least for now.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Have a Godot project\n- Export for macOS , Distribution type App Store (Requires you have app store distribution certificates/identifiers, profiles etc)\n- Once you have your output .pkg use the Transporter app to upload this to the Apple App Store (or just use the Verify function, that does the verification without uploading it)\n- Get error about missing LSMinimumSystemVersion key in info.plist\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nNot project specific","closed_by":{"login":"lostminds","id":17763524,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzYzNTI0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17763524?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds","html_url":"https://github.com/lostminds","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123372/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,